```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>com.example</groupId>
    <artifactId>fake-data-generator</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.0</version>
</dependency>
```

### Gradle

Добавьте в `build.gradle`:

```groovy
implementation 'com.example:fake-data-generator:1.0.0'
```

